        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n    subgraph Client [\&quot;Frontend Layer (React 18 + Vite + Bootstrap)\&quot;]\n        UI_Cust[Customer Portal]\n        UI_Off[Bank Officer Portal]\n        UI_Adm[Admin Console]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Server [\&quot;Backend Layer (Python 3.11 + Django 4.2 + DRF)\&quot;]\n        JWT[JWT Auth &amp; RBAC Middleware]\n        API[REST API Endpoints /api/v1/]\n        ORM[Django ORM &amp; Atomic Transactions]\n        \n        subgraph Apps [\&quot;10 Core Banking Modules\&quot;]\n            M1[1. Auth]\n            M2[2. Accounts]\n            M3[3. Transfers]\n            M4[4. Bills]\n            M5[5. Loans]\n            M6[6. Investments]\n            M7[7. Support]\n            M8[8. Security/Audit]\n            M9[9. Notifications]\n            M10[10. Dashboard/Reports]\n        end\n    end\n\n    subgraph Database [\&quot;Database Layer (MySQL 8.0 InnoDB)\&quot;]\n        DB[(bankease_db\\n3NF Normalized Tables)]\n    end\n\n    Client -- \&quot;HTTPS / JSON (Axios)\&quot; --&gt; JWT\n    JWT --&gt; API\n    API --&gt; Apps\n    Apps --&gt; ORM\n    ORM -- \&quot;mysqlclient / PyMySQL\&quot; --&gt; DB&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="i2GLUnLbZ4GjTIe2rxTi-1">
